        "attribution": "Feldmann and Maini are directly associated with the conceptual and clinical development that established TNF inhibition in rheumatoid arthritis.",
        "maturity": "Its clinical effectiveness, mechanistic relevance, and influence on subsequent immunotherapies have been demonstrated over decades.",
